{"4272370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coal Duty", "steam_appid": 4272370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4755480], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/f06903b2dea999d01acea4a9d5db1f5e.avif?t=1787784754\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coal Duty is a 1–5 player co-op extraction horror-comedy. Under a frozen sky and an iron-fisted regime, descend into creature-infested mines, meet your state coal quota, and quietly plan your way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine &amp; Meet the Quota</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent into the depths to mine coal and extract valuable resources. Miss the quota, and the consequences follow you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.poster.avif?t=1787784754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.webm?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.mp4?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Loitering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you may enjoy your free time after hard work. Just remember who provides it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.poster.avif?t=1787784754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.webm?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.mp4?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mines are home to dozens of distinct creatures. Some are blind. Some are fast. Some look like coal until they aren't. Proceed accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.poster.avif?t=1787784754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.webm?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.mp4?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There Are Ways Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through to forbidden zones and build your escape plan between your shifts. Some miners have reportedly escaped. The state does not confirm this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.poster.avif?t=1787784754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.webm?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.mp4?t=1787784754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–5 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mines with depth-based difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent hub: barracks, workshop, hidden tavern, and a smuggler in the restricted area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple escape routes and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Union on Discord for updates!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/f06903b2dea999d01acea4a9d5db1f5e.avif?t=1787784754\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coal Duty is a 1–5 player co-op extraction horror-comedy. Under a frozen sky and an iron-fisted regime, descend into creature-infested mines, meet your state coal quota, and quietly plan your way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine &amp; Meet the Quota</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent into the depths to mine coal and extract valuable resources. Miss the quota, and the consequences follow you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da